WEBVTT

00:42:27.579 --> 00:42:31.454
do whatever you want with it. We're
able to enforce rules on it.

00:42:31.829 --> 00:42:36.204
We also think and this is part of
the mission that like something

00:42:36.204 --> 00:42:40.329
the field was doing a lot of that we
didn't feel good about was sort of saying

00:42:40.329 --> 00:42:43.954
like, oh, we're going to keep the pace
of progress and capabilities secret.

00:42:44.329 --> 00:42:47.038
That doesn't feel right, because
I think we do need

00:42:47.038 --> 00:42:50.329
a societal conversation about
what's what's going on here,

00:42:50.329 --> 00:42:51.371
what the impacts are going to be.

00:42:51.746 --> 00:42:56.079
And so we although we don't always say,
like, you know, here's the super weapon,

00:42:56.079 --> 00:43:00.746
hopefully we do try to say, like, this is
really serious. This is a big deal.